 1564                                   ; pring2
 1565                                   ;
 1566                                   ; Pixel Ring for explosions; small pixels. Enter with:
 1567                                   ; in_buf=# pixels this ring
 1568                                   ; +4=X centre
 1569                                   ; +8=Y centre
 1570                                   ; +12=Z centre          ;all 16:16 frax
